      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As much as they wish being together was enough. There are new obstacles ahead, somehow they have to deal with being a part again and do their best to maintain their love.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
